Saruman, the White Hand in BRU, built to Bracket 3 rules. This guide is a starting point generated from the decklist — the sections below group what the deck actually contains by what each card is there to do.

# The commander
Saruman, the White Hand :: Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, amass Orcs X, where X is that spell's mana value.

# Game Changers (3 of 3)
Cyclonic Rift :: Return target nonland permanent you don't control to its owner's hand.
Demonic Tutor :: Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.
Opposition Agent :: You control your opponents while they're searching their libraries.

# Removal you can point anywhere
Deathmark :: Destroy target green or white creature.
Feed the Swarm :: Destroy target creature or enchantment an opponent controls. You lose life equal to that permanent's mana value.
Reality Shift :: Exile target creature. Its controller manifests the top card of their library.
Flame of Anor :: Choose one. If you control a Wizard as you cast this spell, you may choose two instead.

# Sweepers
Brotherhood's End :: Choose one —
Perish :: Destroy all green creatures. They can't be regenerated.
Virtue's Ruin :: Destroy all white creatures.

# Card advantage
Baral, Chief of Compliance :: Instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.
Impulse :: Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library…
Merchant Scroll :: Search your library for a blue instant card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.
Muddle the Mixture :: Counter target instant or sorcery spell.
Dimir Machinations :: Look at the top three cards of target player's library. Exile any number of those cards, then put the rest back in…
Grim Tutor :: Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle. You lose 3 life.

# Ramp
An Offer You Can't Refuse :: Counter target noncreature spell. Its controller creates two Treasure tokens.
Dark Ritual :: Add {B}{B}{B}.
Rite of Flame :: Add {R}{R}, then add {R} for each card named Rite of Flame in each graveyard.
Imprisoned in the Moon :: Enchant creature, land, or planeswalker
Seething Song :: Add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.

# Protection
Spell Snare :: Counter target spell with mana value 2.
Wash Away :: Cleave {1}{U}{U}
Counterspell :: Counter target spell.
Lazotep Plating :: Amass Zombies 1.
Mana Drain :: Counter target spell. At the beginning of your next main phase, add an amount of {C} equal to that spell's mana value.
Mana Sculpt :: Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to cast that…
